abstract: >-
  A practical guide to configuring an AI email agent on a custom domain:
  domain planning, DNS records (MX, SPF, DKIM, DMARC), outbound sending,
  inbound webhooks, loop prevention, security, troubleshooting and compliance
  thresholds, with machine-readable reference data.
